This package includes word counts derived from the Google Books Ngram dataset,
English, version 20200217, by Google Books (https://books.google.com/ngrams).
The source data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
Unported License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Source data
© 2019 Google. The counts were summed over years, lowercased, stripped of
part-of-speech tags and cut to the most frequent entries. Google does not
endorse this package.
